Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-早安-早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,安静一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.39,0:00:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次S1大乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-拜托大家了-请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次企划是对粉丝们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,进行回馈活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,用身体帮他们舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,都要参加进来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么首先自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,想要大家一起努力\N（葵司）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是unpai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我的大奶子来满足你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来架乃由罗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢祭我也会好好享受的\N请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,非常激情的发言呢\N没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那么小宵虎南
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次参加感谢祭就是大乱交
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好好享受的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,说的不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来本乡爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是S1乐园\N大家好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.93,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会努力的请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么下一位三上悠亚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是最后的感谢祭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来miru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,久违的感谢祭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很紧张\N但是我会努力让大家舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那么最后一位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次参加 我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张感不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那么大家最后\N说一下我们的主题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,S1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大感谢祭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,2023
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,S1计划
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-让我们 -帮你实现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(S1感谢祭大乱交)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,SSIS816
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（三上悠亚）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,（葵司）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,（小宵虎南）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（山手梨爱）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,M性感按摩店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,(M性感按摩店)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天的负责人三上悠亚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是小宵虎南
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是山手梨爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是葵司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-失礼了哦-很紧张吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个你写的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是个问卷调查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好有趣 不知道M啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那么今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定可能变成M哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吗-嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,做好觉悟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那么可以趴下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个呢-脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股都露出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很害羞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是故意的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么上精油了哦\N-开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,猜猜我们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-想看吗-嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了的事情哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-放松一点哦-好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不知道M吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得自己是M吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,平时做爱不是M吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道吗 喜欢被动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我要开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-感受到了吗-嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么继续了哦-好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,平时多久自慰一次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-每天-每天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看着色情的AV吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜欢乳头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 在发抖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-还没摸呢 -就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头都硬了 硬梆梆的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那么下半身也来一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,屁眼都滑进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-舒服吗-舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股非常敏感哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-之前试过这样吗\N-没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-舒服吗-舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-很想要玩弄乳头吧吧\N-嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都在发抖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,腿也有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,知道是什么碰到了吗
