Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-好厉害-舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
