Dialogue: 0,3:19:51.77,3:19:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好想要啊
Dialogue: 0,3:19:55.19,3:19:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:19:57.62,3:20:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-快给我吧 -好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:20:02.48,3:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,3:20:06.49,3:20:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,3:20:09.38,3:20:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:20:15.32,3:20:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了 肉棒好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:20:20.09,3:20:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:20:21.44,3:20:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-好刺激啊-好开心
Dialogue: 0,3:20:29.58,3:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,3:20:34.25,3:20:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-好舒服我要射了\N-要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:20:36.48,3:20:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来吧 全都射出来吧
Dialogue: 0,3:20:41.51,3:20:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,射了
Dialogue: 0,3:20:48.25,3:20:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,3:20:52.35,3:20:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:20:58.43,3:21:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-主人-好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:21:03.29,3:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,3:21:07.30,3:21:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,3:21:10.23,3:21:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,3:21:14.23,3:21:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,清理一下吧
Dialogue: 0,3:21:18.77,3:21:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好色啊
Dialogue: 0,3:21:26.39,3:21:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,主人美味的精液
Dialogue: 0,3:21:35.39,3:21:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的口交怎么样啊主人
Dialogue: 0,3:21:40.42,3:21:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要再来吗
Dialogue: 0,3:21:44.00,3:21:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还会继续服侍你哦
Dialogue: 0,3:21:59.54,3:22:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（葵司）
Dialogue: 0,3:22:08.38,3:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（山手梨爱）
Dialogue: 0,3:22:16.82,3:22:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（本乡爱）
Dialogue: 0,3:22:25.82,3:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,（架乃由罗）
Dialogue: 0,3:22:35.22,3:22:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,无内衣诱惑
Dialogue: 0,3:22:38.77,3:22:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,（无内衣诱惑 抛弃理性）\N（射精无数次）
Dialogue: 0,3:22:49.31,3:22:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-辛苦了-辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,3:22:50.73,3:22:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-辛苦了-辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,3:22:53.06,3:22:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来的话
Dialogue: 0,3:22:56.31,3:22:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说不出口
Dialogue: 0,3:23:00.45,3:23:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么-表情很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,3:23:05.15,3:23:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这个僵硬的表情
Dialogue: 0,3:23:08.86,3:23:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,用你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,3:23:11.03,3:23:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他扭转一下
Dialogue: 0,3:23:15.66,3:23:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这次主题是无内衣诱惑
Dialogue: 0,3:23:19.97,3:23:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,3:23:23.78,3:23:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想要你们用无内衣
Dialogue: 0,3:23:28.41,3:23:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-让他笑起来吧-笑吗
Dialogue: 0,3:23:31.93,3:23:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,3:23:34.62,3:23:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-该怎么做呢\N-我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,3:23:38.23,3:23:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我主动吧
Dialogue: 0,3:23:40.43,3:23:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样子如何
Dialogue: 0,3:23:43.20,3:23:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,确实呢
Dialogue: 0,3:23:44.90,3:23:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-你的比较大 跳一跳吧\N-跳吗
Dialogue: 0,3:23:48.65,3:23:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-是这样子吗`-没错
Dialogue: 0,3:23:51.84,3:23:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,3:23:53.45,3:23:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个也不错\N-我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,3:23:57.62,3:24:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我让他看下面吧
Dialogue: 0,3:24:03.50,3:24:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-猜拳吧 -嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:24:06.23,3:24:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,石头剪刀布
Dialogue: 0,3:24:09.38,3:24:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,石头剪刀布
Dialogue: 0,3:24:13.06,3:24:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,石头剪刀布
Dialogue: 0,3:24:15.52,3:24:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-234
Dialogue: 0,3:24:18.48,3:24:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么出发吧-加油
Dialogue: 0,3:24:20.48,3:24:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:24:23.38,3:24:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-我都搞错方向了 -走吧
Dialogue: 0,3:24:29.88,3:24:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吗-去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:24:33.66,3:24:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,加油哦
Dialogue: 0,3:24:37.86,3:24:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:40.36,3:24:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了 吃点什么吗
Dialogue: 0,3:24:42.83,3:24:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我都香蕉掉了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:44.76,3:24:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N可以帮我捡一下香蕉吗
Dialogue: 0,3:24:54.19,3:24:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我都香蕉\N刚好有点饿了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:59.55,3:25:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吃个香蕉吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:06.08,3:25:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:10.62,3:25:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃 你要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,3:25:12.82,3:25:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:13.64,3:25:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我喂你吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:15.91,3:25:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就一点点
Dialogue: 0,3:25:21.10,3:25:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了呢 好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,3:25:24.65,3:25:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:25:29.02,3:25:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吃饱了我要走了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:32.47,3:25:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 谢谢你帮我捡
Dialogue: 0,3:25:37.17,3:25:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,3:25:38.61,3:25:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起又掉了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:40.88,3:25:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以帮我捡一下吗我够不着
Dialogue: 0,3:25:51.06,3:25:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:25:53.03,3:25:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:25:56.06,3:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子吃饱了走吧
Dialogue: 0,3:25:59.64,3:26:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,3:26:00.92,3:26:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-有一点点反应 -加油
Dialogue: 0,3:26:04.90,3:26:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:10.91,3:26:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要一起吃香蕉
Dialogue: 0,3:26:21.91,3:26:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃香蕉吗
Dialogue: 0,3:26:24.74,3:26:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:27.37,3:26:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,3:26:30.39,3:26:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,3:26:37.62,3:26:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不一起热身吗
Dialogue: 0,3:26:44.91,3:26:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,3:26:47.11,3:26:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,给你吃香蕉
Dialogue: 0,3:26:53.72,3:26:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,3:26:55.75,3:26:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯嗯-太好了
Dialogue: 0,3:26:59.99,3:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:02.32,3:27:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:05.61,3:27:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,3:27:07.94,3:27:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-回来了-怎么样吃了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:27:09.85,3:27:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-吃了-好温柔
Dialogue: 0,3:27:13.00,3:27:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,3:27:15.47,3:27:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-那我去了哦-加油
Dialogue: 0,3:27:26.28,3:27:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,乳房下面好难受
Dialogue: 0,3:27:29.99,3:27:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好难受 就是这里
Dialogue: 0,3:27:34.52,3:27:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这里非常难受啊
Dialogue: 0,3:27:37.51,3:27:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看
Dialogue: 0,3:27:39.75,3:27:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,下乳房
Dialogue: 0,3:27:42.73,3:27:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都流汗了
Dialogue: 0,3:27:46.45,3:27:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:48.12,3:27:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你摸摸看
Dialogue: 0,3:27:51.64,3:27:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:57.55,3:27:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,3:28:01.30,3:28:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的下乳房好难受
Dialogue: 0,3:28:04.71,3:28:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还有副乳也好痒
Dialogue: 0,3:28:07.67,3:28:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我抓一抓
Dialogue: 0,3:28:10.83,3:28:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看
Dialogue: 0,3:28:18.91,3:28:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,3:28:21.17,3:28:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了下一个
Dialogue: 0,3:28:24.76,3:28:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吓人 -没事吧
Dialogue: 0,3:28:28.50,3:28:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的香蕉道具
Dialogue: 0,3:28:32.67,3:28:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去很胭
Dialogue: 0,3:28:35.34,3:28:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:28:37.70,3:28:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好热真的好热
Dialogue: 0,3:28:42.73,3:28:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,汗太多了 你要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,3:28:46.34,3:28:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要了 -是吗
Dialogue: 0,3:28:48.77,3:28:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好热 真的好热啊
Dialogue: 0,3:28:52.78,3:28:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太热了真的好热
Dialogue: 0,3:28:56.20,3:28:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不热吗
Dialogue: 0,3:28:58.37,3:29:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-有一点点 -是吗
Dialogue: 0,3:29:01.06,3:29:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,3:29:03.89,3:29:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不行别这样 这是我的
Dialogue: 0,3:29:08.65,3:29:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个和香蕉一样啊
Dialogue: 0,3:29:14.92,3:29:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-结束了吗\N-我怯场回来了
Dialogue: 0,3:29:19.46,3:29:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-笑了 -是吗
Dialogue: 0,3:29:24.65,3:29:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-肯定觉得我们奇怪\N-这样应该不行
Dialogue: 0,3:29:29.97,3:29:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,3:29:31.42,3:29:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要性感一点
Dialogue: 0,3:29:34.67,3:29:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-说的也是 拿出本性吧\N-是的啊
Dialogue: 0,3:29:38.94,3:29:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,色色的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:29:42.72,3:29:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-用奶子来吧-一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:30:02.14,3:30:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很多烦心事吗
Dialogue: 0,3:30:05.75,3:30:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的 -是累了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:30:09.04,3:30:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,活着很无聊
Dialogue: 0,3:30:12.29,3:30:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,3:30:16.16,3:30:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那么怎么做你才会笑呢
Dialogue: 0,3:30:23.89,3:30:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么失礼了-乳头硬了
Dialogue: 0,3:30:27.89,3:30:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:30:31.28,3:30:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-硬梆梆的乳头 -好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,3:30:35.12,3:30:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,3:30:36.93,3:30:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-乳头很敏感吗-是的
Dialogue: 0,3:30:40.54,3:30:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗-真不错
Dialogue: 0,3:30:45.67,3:30:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢女孩子哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,3:30:51.94,3:30:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,3:30:54.41,3:30:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是
Dialogue: 0,3:30:56.94,3:30:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-奶子-奶子吗
Dialogue: 0,3:31:00.12,3:31:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-喜欢奶子吗-最爱了
Dialogue: 0,3:31:02.82,3:31:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真凑巧
Dialogue: 0,3:31:06.07,3:31:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天都没穿
Dialogue: 0,3:31:09.09,3:31:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-没内衣-无内衣哦
Dialogue: 0,3:31:11.95,3:31:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:31:14.74,3:31:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好色
Dialogue: 0,3:31:18.79,3:31:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 喜欢奶子啊
Dialogue: 0,3:31:22.63,3:31:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么摸一下就会有精神了\N-是的
Dialogue: 0,3:31:27.33,3:31:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要摸摸看吗
Dialogue: 0,3:31:29.63,3:31:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吗-给你摸
Dialogue: 0,3:31:35.34,3:31:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-好厉害-这里也要
Dialogue: 0,3:31:37.12,3:31:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:31:39.81,3:31:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那么让我们玩一下这里
Dialogue: 0,3:31:46.51,3:31:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,奶子如何啊
Dialogue: 0,3:31:50.42,3:31:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,3:31:53.22,3:31:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好软
Dialogue: 0,3:31:56.08,3:31:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,幸福吗
Dialogue: 0,3:31:57.75,3:31:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很幸福
Dialogue: 0,3:31:59.23,3:32:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有精神了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:32:02.32,3:32:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了 -好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:32:06.98,3:32:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-真不错-好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:32:09.18,3:32:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-看我们的奶子吧-好大
Dialogue: 0,3:32:18.68,3:32:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这里
Dialogue: 0,3:32:21.27,3:32:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-好软啊 -真的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:32:23.74,3:32:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-尽情摸吧 -好的
Dialogue: 0,3:32:28.31,3:32:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-别客气 -嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:32:31.16,3:32:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的很喜欢呢 -超爱的
Dialogue: 0,3:32:36.45,3:32:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,耳朵好红
Dialogue: 0,3:32:37.60,3:32:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,3:32:42.37,3:32:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:32:44.80,3:32:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,隔着衣服也可以吗
Dialogue: 0,3:32:48.25,3:32:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这样满足了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:32:51.07,3:32:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-想要看吗-嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:32:54.00,3:32:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么办-怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,3:32:58.40,3:33:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-有精神了呢-是的呢
Dialogue: 0,3:33:01.95,3:33:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看看会更有精神吧
Dialogue: 0,3:33:05.27,3:33:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:33:07.30,3:33:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那么给他看看吧
Dialogue: 0,3:33:11.02,3:33:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一二一起吧
Dialogue: 0,3:33:20.31,3:33:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-如何-看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,3:33:24.03,3:33:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢哪个啊
Dialogue: 0,3:33:27.15,3:33:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-靠近点吧 -这个
Dialogue: 0,3:33:30.93,3:33:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-这个吗-喜欢哪个
Dialogue: 0,3:33:33.29,3:33:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-好厉害 无法选择\N-非常幸福吧
Dialogue: 0,3:33:38.09,3:33:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-被我们包围着-好厉害
